sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant API as PayPoint API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Provider
  C->>API: POST /sales + Idempotency-Key
  rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
    Note over API,DB: Transaction 1
    API->>DB: advisory lock on the key, replay if it exists
    API->>DB: UPDATE balance WHERE balance >= amount
    API->>DB: INSERT sale PENDING + SALE ledger entry, COMMIT
  end
  API->>P: top-up, outside any transaction, with timeout
  alt confirmed
    API->>DB: sale CONFIRMED
  else rejected
    API->>DB: Transaction 2: sale FAILED + REFUND ledger entry
  else no answer
    API-->>C: PENDING, money stays reserved
  end
